get.description:
Returns the pair's latest quote or a typed absence. `price` is quote-currency units per base-currency unit;
`price_time` is the quoted time and `refreshed_at` the observation time. Bid, ask, and previous close are null
with reasons in `field_states`; quotes during the weekly closure have no day.

Returns OHLCV bars adjusted for splits and cash dividends (`price_basis: split_dividend_adjusted`) through the
latest available corporate action listed by `/corporate-actions`. Daily bars (`interval=1d`) cover `start` to `end`;
intraday bars (`15m`, `1h`) are the newest `limit` bars up to `end`. Page back with `coverage.continue_end` as
`end`, down to `coverage.history_from`. `coverage.complete` says whether every requested session is accounted for;
each bar's `field_states` names any value with a limit a client can act on, with its `reason` and `retry`.
Unsupported listings return `404 not_supported`, and uncovered windows return a typed error.
